pan style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Clean-room recovery environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;separate tenant, no production trust&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A365D;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c124"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="104.0" width="220.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c128" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5a · Managed IoMT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;infusion pumps, monitors&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c127"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="32.0" width="156.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c129" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5b · Legacy enclave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;unpatchable devices&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c127"><mxGeometry x="174.0" y="32.0" width="156.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c130" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5c · Imaging modalities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;CT, MRI, X-ray, US&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c127"><mxGeometry x="338.0" y="32.0" width="156.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c131" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5d · Lab &amp;amp; pharmacy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;analyzers, dispensing cabinets&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c127"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="108.0" width="156.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c132" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Device integration gateway&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;the only path from devices to clinical applications&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF5F5;strokeColor=#C53030;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c127"><mxGeometry x="174.0" y="108.0" width="320.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c134" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Building management &amp;amp; HVAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;isolated from clinical zones&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8D6E4F;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c133"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="32.0" width="220.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c135" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Nurse call · RTLS · access control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#4A5568;&quot;&gt;vendor-managed, monitored&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8D6E4F;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1A202C;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="c133"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="108.0" width="220.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c137" value="• Default deny between zones; only the numbered conduits (C1–C12) are permitted.&lt;br&gt;• Every conduit is authenticated, encrypted and logged to the SIEM.&lt;br&gt;• Solid arrow = permitted data flow (arrow shows who initiates).&lt;br&gt;• Dashed arrow = administrative, one-way or telemetry-only flow.&lt;br&gt;• Each zone has one policy authority (Section 5.2)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.2;fontColor=#2D3748;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c136"><mxGeometry x="12.0" y="28.0" width="380.0" height="160.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="C1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#2D3748;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.4900;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.4900;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2D3748;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c88" target="c94"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="C2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#2D3748;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.3808;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.6972;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2D3748;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c94" target="c110"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="C3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#2D3748;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.3204;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2D3748;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c100" target="c110"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell